<item><title>25/106 Woodend Water Main Renewals, Stormwater and Footpath Upgrade 2026/27</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Water Renewal, Stormwater and Footpaths within Main North Road (State Highway 1) and side streets in Woodend, Waimakariri.<br /><br />Installation of Water Main via Trenchless methodology where practical.<br /><br />The main tasks involved in this Contract are:<br /><br />Supply and install of the following water infrastructure:<br /><br />o	40m of 250mm OD PE100-RC PN12.5 Water Main<br /><br />o	515m of 180mm OD PE100-RC PN12.5 Water Main<br /><br />o	500m of 125mm OD PE100-RC PN12.5 Water Main<br /><br />o	181m of 63mm OD PE100-RC PN 12.5 Rider Main<br /><br />o	229m of 35mm, 25mm and 20mm OD Service Lateral<br /><br />o	Multiple water details involving; fire hydrants, valves, thrust blocks, bends and other fittings.<br /><br />o	33 Service Connections requiring upgrade and/or transfer to new main.<br /><br />o	Abandonment of redundant Water Main and associated surface features.<br /><br />Water Mains and Rider Mains within the Carriageway of Main North Road (State Highway 1) are preferred to be installed v...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 07/Oct/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2677<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Utilities, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 9]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.nz/PublicTenderAccess.aspx?id=c33c90f75f8d4206b90a03fbbd83273as2677</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">c33c90f75f8d4206b90a03fbbd83273a</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 03:32:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
<category>Utilities</category>
<category>Water &amp; Sewage</category>
</item>
<item><title>Rangiora Eastern Link Programme Manager - third term</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Rangiora Eastern Link<br /><br />- progress appointment of designer<br /><br />- complete investigations<br /><br />- design and contract documentation<br /><br />- appoint contractor<br /><br />- carry out ECI<br /><br />- procure land<br /><br />- obtain consents<br /><br />- prep documentation to obtain construction funding<br /><br />Strategic and Business Case Services – strategic planning, and business case development for priority stormwater, wastewater and flood management initiatives. Provide advice as required. Examples include:<br /><br />Rangiora Stormwater Management Plan<br /><br />Mandeville flood mgt<br /><br />Oxford WWTP<br /><br />Animal Shelter - provide advice as required<br /><br />Development team - project management and specialist advisory services for other Council projects commissioned on an agreed, task-by-task basis.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 16/Sep/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2672<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Engineer, Research, Tech services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
