<item><title>24/51 Kippenberger/Elm Green Playground Development - Civil Works</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This procurement plan is only for the Civil Works component of this project. The procurement of the playground equipment is covered by VP2026-109. The civil works include<br /><br />- Construction of a 1.2 m mound for access to the flying fox<br /><br />- Construction of 193 m2 of concrete footpaths<br /><br />- Construction of 6 garden beds including plantings<br /><br />- Construction of 6 tree pits including tree installation<br /><br />- Construction of 105 m of new post and cable fence including vehicle entrance<br /><br />- Construction of 74 m of Subsoil Drain<br /><br />- Construction of all soft fall areas for play equipment<br /><br />- Supply and Installation of 3 bike racks and one litter bin.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 16/Sep/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2666<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 9]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.nz/tsi.axd?id=87d0279c59124eefb6211e0dac6a859as2666s85818252ab0f4a97ad4749bb758701e4s12</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">87d0279c59124eefb6211e0dac6a859a</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 05:20:00 GMT</pubDate>
